  m_text: 'We are proud of how fast our employees work, and with what enthusiasm.
    In order for all employees to strive only for the best, we calculated how much
    it takes on average for each product, and therefore we set a timer for you, which
    is updated with the sorting of each item. We kindly ask you not to be lazy and
    keep up with the timer, otherwise we will have to part with you.


    Clicking
    next page will start your work and timer!!!


'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e5ead3a3a8bc234e8dda5e05181ad25, type: 2}
